墨絰合眾，誅殺異己，仍遣前呉國內史虞嘯父等入呉興、義興聚兵，輕俠赴者萬計。廞自謂義兵一動，勢必未寧，可乘間而取富貴。而曾不旬日，國寶賜死，恭罷兵符，廞去職。廞大怒，回眾討恭。恭遣司馬劉牢之距戰于曲阿，廞眾潰奔走，遂不知所在。長子泰爲恭所殺，少子華以不知廞存亡，憂毀布衣蔬食。後從兄謐言其死所，華始發喪，入仕。","source_term":"少子華"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-jinshu065-phase3-022","interpretation_note":"少子僅幼少稱謂，不把少字改成排行二。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}},{"id":"95d_c34_dd3","label":"王鴻","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"鴻","mention_ids":["c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line026:m0004"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-063","source_id":"s-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou","chapter_id":"c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line026","mention_id":"c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line026:m0004","quote":"鴻"}],"identity_note":"本批完整傳文來源候選；不因同姓或同名接族。","review":"ai_provisional"}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou","work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-063","chapter_id":"c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line026:m0004"],"paragraph_ids":["c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line026"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line026:m0004","mention_ids":["c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line026:m0004"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":1,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"1處獨立位置，1個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interp